  "goodToKnow": "Die Freilassung is the release of a prisoner, hostage or detainee: die Freilassung fordern (to demand the release), die vorzeitige Freilassung (early release). The verb is freilassen (separable): Die Geiseln wurden freigelassen. Gegen Kaution freilassen means to release on bail. Die Entlassung is also used, especially aus dem Gefängnis, but it also means dismissal from a job. Plural: die Freilassungen."
